# Global Rules

## Codebase information

Directories:

- `src/components`: All React components
- `src/routes`: All router pages
- `src/lib`: Our local library of hooks, utilities, and UI components.
- `src/config`: The web application config and theme.
- `src/clients`: Clients to interact with external services.
- `apps/`: All standalone apps, such as the Avandar CLI.
- `packages/`: All avandar libraries that are publishable as their own packages

Libraries:

- Bundler: Vite v7
- Frontend framework: React v19
- UI library: Mantine v9
- Router: Tanstack Router v1
- Querying: Tanstack Query v5
- Schema validation: Zod v4
- Database and Auth: Supabase JS v2
- Linter: ESLint v9
- Formatter: Prettier v3
- CSS Styles: TailwindCSS v3
- Icons: Tabler Icons v3

## Library usage

- Always use the Context7 MCP to reference the most up-to-date documentation for
  any library listed here.
- Use the library versions referenced in this document. Do not look up
  documentation from older versions.

## Style guides

Canonical copies live in `docs/rules/`. Sibling rules in this directory load
them when matching files are in context:

- TypeScript: `docs/rules/typescript.md`
- SQL: `docs/rules/sql.md`
- Unit/integration tests: `docs/rules/testing.md`
- E2E tests: `docs/rules/e2e-testing.md`
- CSS: `docs/rules/css.md`
- Internationalization: `docs/rules/i18n.md`
